[h1]R.A.T.S. Clean Screen 0.2.0: no code any more[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

The version label of the beta branch stays off the screen, and now it takes two ini lines instead of a plugin: a config patch sets the game's own [b]ShowVersionWatermark[/b] to False. No mod loader needed. Switch the mod off in the Mods menu to get the label back.

Run in the game on the 3D globe public beta (build 261107): a mission shows no version label. 0.8.7 not run.

[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3836386468]R.A.T.S. Clean Screen on the Workshop[/url]

[i]R.A.T.S. – Ratte's Assorted Tactical Systems[/i]
